"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>A <b>queen</b> is usually the wife of a <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t226-v2\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">king</data>. A queen is usually of lower status than the king, but higher status than everyone else. Sometimes, a queen might be the daughter of a king, and that daughter might rule her country after her father dies if her father had no son to become king after him. In biblical times, some queens had a lot of power, while other queens did not have much power.</p>",
